{"id":"5e2f71764c556aa9","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-exp.md","title":"Exponential Time","display":"df-exp — Exponential Time","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","depends_on":["[[28-df-dtime]]"],"display":"df-exp — Exponential Time","label":"28-df-exp","aliases":["28-df-exp"],"type":"definition"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-exp — Exponential Time"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-exp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-exp</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\">\\(\\mathrm{DTIME}(t)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9ed6fa1ce1934897\" href=\"?note=9ed6fa1ce1934897\" title=\"28-df-dtime\">28-df-dtime</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{EXP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{(n+2)^a}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{EXP}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{a\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}}\\mathrm{DTIME}(n\\mapsto2^{(n+2)^a}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\mathrm{poly}(n)}\">\\(2^{\\mathrm{poly}(n)}\\)</span> 时间的并类；有限短输入及多项式中的常数可由指数次数和机器常数吸收。</p>\n<p>来源核对：§2.6.2；印刷56页；PDF82页。陈述已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"